add(13,'P2','N','Metric methods document gives the wrong low-boost denominator','docs/METRIC_METHODS.md','| `low_boost_pct`','Documentation divides low seconds by tracked_seconds; implementation and versioned dictionary divide by valid boost seconds. Missing boost changes the numerical result.', 'Compare docs row with EvidenceCollector metrics and extracted research image28.', 'Docs and source disagree; code/research formula correctly exclude missing boost from denominator.', 'Generate method reference from the versioned metric dictionary and remove duplicate manual formulas.',effort='S',lead='confirmed',evidence='review/research-formulas/white-0.png image28; crates/replay-core/src/lib.rs:769')
add(14,'P2','B','Duration/count aggregates have no normalized rate alternative','crates/coach-services/src/analytics.rs','let weighted = !valid.is_empty()','Duration/count metrics are equal-match means, which is a valid descriptive average but not comparable behavior intensity across forfeits, overtime and different lengths. Coach receives these near time-weighted metrics without a clear unit-specific aggregation contract.', 'Two matches with identical boost-at-speed rate but durations 60 and 360 seconds produce different raw-duration observations.', 'Count/duration averages respond to match length; method string combines legacy weights unavailable with duration/count metrics.', 'Preserve per-match means where useful, add rate/share alternatives and a typed aggregation method per metric; make completion/coverage explicit.',lead='confirmed')
add(15,'P2','B','There is no metric re-derivation path for existing libraries','crates/coach-services/src/reenrich.rs','//! user data are never rewritten;','Re-enrichment explicitly updates only capture data, never metrics/events; no source metric version upgrade/recompute operation exists. The exported functions are also absent from registered IPC.', 'Search reenrich in src-tauri/src and compare apply_reenrichment SQL; existing test asserts metrics unchanged.', 'New metric keys/formula fixes only reach new imports; stale libraries cannot be upgraded through the app.', 'Implement immutable source replay plus versioned derivation records; offer cancellable worker-backed recomputation and rebuild dependent caches.',effort='L',lead='confirmed',evidence='crates/coach-services/src/reenrich.rs:145-168; src-tauri/src/main.rs invoke_handler list; stale_replay_is_enriched_without_touching_metrics_and_invalidates_cache test')
add(16,'P2','A','Metric dictionary does not cover scoreboard and touch metrics that the parser emits','app/src/data/metrics.json','"metrics": [','The authoritative dictionary omits goals, assists, saves, shots, score and touches, including important count semantics/heuristic confidence. It includes suspected_unnecessary_boost_s despite no producer.', 'Compare parser metric keys with JSON catalog; rg suspected finds catalog only.', 'A dictionary claimed authoritative cannot explain or validate several production metrics and advertises a permanently unavailable one.', 'Make catalog complete and machine-check producer/consumer coverage; separate planned research metrics from produced metrics.',effort='S',lead='confirmed')
