add(20,'P2','A','Match completion and roster changes are not represented in analytics eligibility','crates/replay-core/src/types.rs','pub struct ReplaySummary','ReplaySummary lacks completion/forfeit/leaver/mutator/season metadata. Analytics provenance asks for these absent keys and accepts all metric-bearing matches, making comparison cohorts unable to distinguish shortened or materially different play.', 'Inspect summary type, analytics match_provenance JSON and eligibility chain.', 'Short matches are included with no completion reason; source_revision cannot explain forfeits or team roster context.', 'Capture available completion/playlist/mutator signals with unknown states; use explicit cohort policy rather than arbitrary 210-second rejection.',effort='L',lead='confirmed')
